Good point. Each project needs phase state. Currently `projects.json` has basic metadata but no workflow tracking.

Quick addition to the project schema:

```json
{
  "P001": {
    "name": "...",
    "phase": "ideation",
    "phase_history": [
      {"phase": "ideation", "entered": "2026-09-07T10:00:00Z"}
